A hidden test instance (ArdiaCore sets g_ardia_background_instance from --ardia-background, which the app passes for
ARDIA_BACKGROUND) never makes itself a system default: shell_integration's SetAsDefaultBrowser,
SetAsDefaultClientForScheme and SetAsDefaultHandlerForUTType log a line and return false. Every Chrome path goes
through them (chrome://settings' Make default, the default browser prompt, a protocol handler made default), so an
agent's click in a scratch copy can't change the owner's default browser, mail client or PDF reader, and
SetAsDefaultBrowser no longer activates CoreServicesUIAgent over the owner's work.

